елает, чтобы вы поклонялись Ему и не поклонялись наряду с Ним ничему иному, и чтобы держались все вы за вервь Аллаха и не разделялись, а не желает Он, чтобы (занимались) вы пересудами, (задавали) множество вопросов и (понапрасну) расточали (свои) средства”»","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f07af8","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":30,"hadithIndex":4482,"bookHadithIndex":13,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f07af9","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":30,"hadithIndex":4483,"bookHadithIndex":14,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f07afa","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":30,"hadithIndex":4484,"bookHadithIndex":15,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f07afb","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":30,"hadithIndex":4485,"bookHadithIndex":16,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f07afc","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":30,"hadithIndex":4486,"bookHadithIndex":17,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f07afd","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":30,"hadithIndex":4487,"bookHadithIndex":18,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f07afe","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":30,"hadithIndex":4488,"bookHadithIndex":19,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f07aff","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":30,"hadithIndex":4489,"bookHadithIndex":20,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f07b00","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":30,"hadithIndex":4490,"bookHadithIndex":21,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f07b01","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":30,"hadithIndex":4491,"bookHadithIndex":22,"text":"","grades":[]},{"id":"69b6c368dd1a4c9c86f07b02","editionId":"69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a131f","bookIndex":30,"hadithIndex":4492,"bookHadithIndex":23,"text":"Сообщается, что ‘Аиша, да будет доволен ею Аллах, сказала: «Посланник Аллаха ﷺ сказал: “Кто в